UPDATE businesses SET description = 'OCTOLINK is a facilities-management operation based at Route 21 Corporate Park in Irene, Centurion, offering a comprehensive range of property maintenance and facilities services to businesses, property owners, commercial facilities and other organisations. Its service offering covers painting and waterproofing, roofing, paving, aluminium work, plumbing and electrical work, and the maintenance of roller shutters and automated doors, together with shopfitting, carpentry, drywalling, ceilings, flooring and wallpapering. The company also provides architectural services, space planning and structural-engineering support, giving clients access to both routine maintenance trades and more technical design and engineering input under one service provider. OCTOLINK operates as a partnership between Tollink South Africa (Pty) Ltd and DVY Properties and Maintenance, combining their respective expertise to deliver facilities maintenance, refurbishment and property-management support. Tollink brings more than two decades of experience in maintenance and operations to the partnership and holds ISO 9001, ISO 14001, ISO 45001 and ISO 27001 certifications, covering quality management, environmental management, occupational health and safety, and information security respectively. This certification base gives commercial clients added assurance when appointing OCTOLINK for ongoing facilities and property-maintenance work.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'octolink-irene' AND description = 'OCTOLINK is a facilities management company based in Irene, Centurion, providing facility maintenance, energy optimisation, security and environmental sustainability solutions, operated in partnership with Tollink South Africa.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
